: 1531185, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scwtgx.jpg"}, {"id": 1531186, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scwtgy.jpg"}, {"id": 1531189, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scwth1.jpg"}, {"id": 1531187, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scwtgz.jpg"}, {"id": 1531184, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scwtgw.jpg"}], "slug": "zombme", "storyline": "You're a zombie, happily enjoying the afterlife (Resting In Paradise).\n\nUnfortunately, they've found a way to cure zombies back into humans...the problem is, you don't want to be human again! Why would you want to worry about brushing your teeth, eating red meat, doing your taxes, etc.?\n\nThe good news is that they didn't manage to fully heal you--just partially expose you to the cure. So you need to find an \"anti-cure\" before your health fully returns and you get transformed back into a human.\n\nKeep your health down by doing things like jumping on spikes, catching on fire, and getting bitten by sharks...and avoid the health-restoring health packs and all the entities trying to turn you back into a human.\n\nCan you stay dead long enough to find the anti-cure??", "summary": "ZombMe is a 2D platformer based on old-school platformers with influences and callbacks to Mario, Sonic, Bonk, Bionic Commando, MetalStorm, and Mega Man. The hook with ZombMe, though, is that you're a zombie who is trying to stay DEAD--so the traditional gameplay mechanics of needing health is reversed: catching fire and jumping on spikes is good, and getting health packs is bad!", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/zombme", "videos": [{"id": 150054, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "WOMFdkIQ8DY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WOMFdkIQ8DY", "title": "ZombMe Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/WOMFdkIQ8DY/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 150055, "name": "Gameplay Video", "video_id": "mExtzgWohxY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mExtzgWohxY", "title": "ZombMe Demo Playthrough", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/mExtzgWohxY/hqdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 150056, "name": "Dev Diary", "video_id": "_U5_qFsmxSE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_U5_qFsmxSE", "title": "ZombMe: Hub World", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/_U5_qFsmxSE/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 150057, "name": "Dev Diary", "video_id": "tm2-d-wnQ2Q", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tm2-d-wnQ2Q", "title": "ZombMe Developer Narration", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/tm2-d-wnQ2Q/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 150058, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "UCS0YsVbVgk", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UCS0YsVbVgk", "title": "Zombie In The City (ZombMe World 7 trailer)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/UCS0YsVbVgk/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}